    // ---- Gplex for Google Photos (5.6) ----------------------------------------------------
    // Picasa Web Albums (2007-2011), Google+ Photos (late 2012-2014) and Google Photos of
    // each period from 2015, drawn over Google's own Photos page, which keeps running
    // underneath: the photos are read from it, and everything done is done by pressing
