    //   s2009 2009-2010: the classic dashboard, the Google bar of the apps, the "Google Sites" logo
    //   s2011 2011-2012: the classic dashboard under the black bar (reconstructed: no dated picture of it)
    //   s2013 2013-2016: the classic dashboard under the grey header (red "Sites", CREATE); Late 2015 runs here as 2016
    //   n2016 2017-2018: the new Sites home of November 2016 (indigo bar, red +)
